[{:adr/authoritative_for ["decision: club-shinshi's V1 crypto monetization is receive-only (buyer -> gftd,\n    one-directional, gftd as ordinary merchant) -- NOT creator payout. Creator payout\n    (buyer -> gftd -> creator) is explicitly deferred to a future ADR/task" "reason for the narrowing: a code-level check of the existing etzhayyim ERC-4337\n    actor infra (EtzhayyimActorRegistry.sol, EtzhayyimPaymaster.sol) found it unsafe to\n    build creator payout on yet -- registry activate() has no access control (DID\n    front-running/hijack), paymaster allowlist doesn't enforce function selector or\n    recipient (contradicts its own README policy), and the deployed self-custody wallet\n    pair lives on etzhayyim's private single-sealer chain, not the public Base L2 the\n    payments policy targets. Paymaster itself is undeployed/unaudited stub v0.0.0" "implementation: 0008_crypto_pay.sql (pay_run ledger) + shinshi.worker.payments\n    (buyer-facing quote/claim/status) + shinshi.worker.d1-gateway ops\n    (list_pending_pay_runs, confirm_pay_run) + nbb.edn/tools/verify-payments.clj --\n    club-shinshi's OWN separate treasury address, never local-murakumo's (ADR-2607052100\n    commingling finding applies to receive-only rails too)" "landed: jk-luxury/club-shinshi#6, merge commit d7f83c2a2e9d8e73afbf53531ba43693c594b9c3\n    (2026-07-08). Amendment: treasury.core is VENDORED at\n    60-apps/.../cljs/src/treasury/core.cljc (pinned kotoba-lang/treasury commit\n    e87e1299fe8562c98ef4b6044a1ad025dd493258), not a live cross-repo source-path --\n    the original relative-sibling-path approach broke CI (club-shinshi's CI and deploy\n    both check out this repo alone, not the full west workspace). Re-verified green in a\n    standalone clone matching CI's checkout shape, then on CI itself, before merging" "Phase 2 landed: jk-luxury/club-shinshi#7, merge commit\n    57f117c6efa81693851952a526db3341aedd4be1 (2026-07-08). SHINSHI_TREASURY_ADDR\n    configured (operator-provisioned, own/separate address); DISPATCHER_INTERNAL_SECRET\n    already live as a Worker secret; ETHERSCAN_API_KEY resolves via a new\n    shinshi-scoped Keychain entry (reused read-only block-explorer key, not a\n    custody credential)" "LIVE (2026-07-09): deployed via wrangler deploy, Version ID\n    802adc09-8deb-4fef-b3bf-06709162135d, shinshi.club. Found + fixed a real gap\n    first: migrations 0007 (creator_billing_daily) and 0008 (pay_run) had never\n    been applied to production D1 (no migrations_dir wired into wrangler.jsonc,\n    confirmed via sqlite_master query before touching anything) -- applied both\n    via `wrangler d1 execute --remote --file=...`, 0007 before 0008. Smoke-tested\n    live: GET /pay/quote returns a correct quote against the real treasury\n    address (80/20 split verified: net=8/fee=2 on usd=10); /pay/status and\n    /pay/claim validation paths return correct 422s; homepage still 200 (no\n    deploy regression). No real USDC transaction has occurred; no legal/\n    compliance certification performed. Phase 3 (wire subscription.cljs/\n    points.cljs UI to /pay/quote+/pay/claim) is the remaining step before\n    Phase 4 (measure :hyp/club-shinshi-creator-take against ExoClick ad revenue)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "shinshi-crypto-payout-rail", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607021900-portfolio-add-isekai-club-shinshi.md.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/club-shinshi 90-docs/adr/2606010100-shinshi-ad-monetization-bmc.md.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/local-murakumo/tools/verify-payments.clj" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/50-infra/etzhayyim-paymaster/README.md" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/50-infra/vultr/geth-private/contracts/src/EtzhayyimActorRegistry.sol"], :adr/status "implemented", :adr/id "adr-2607078100-club-shinshi-receive-only-usdc-rail-creator-payout-deferred", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-09", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607078100: club-shinshi V1 monetization -- receive-only USDC rail (buyer -> gftd), creator payout deferred", :adr/depends_on ["90-docs/adr/2607052100-shinshi-crypto-payout-rail-regulatory-design-review.md.edn" "orgs/kotoba-lang/treasury 90-docs/adr/2607051621-treasury-core-extraction.md.edn" "orgs/etzhayyim/root 90-docs/adr/2605172100-etzhayyim-payments-on-chain-only.md.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp 90-docs/adr/2606011400-consensys-pattern-etzhayyim-product-gftd-infra-vendor.md.edn"]}]